	(descr "ams-OSRAM SFH 2704 A silicon PIN photodiode, 2.0x1.8x0.6mm chip LED package, 1.23x1.23mm active area drawn on F.Fab. Pad 1 = cathode (silkscreen bar side, the terminal next to the package mark), pad 2 = anode. Land pattern is the datasheet recommended solder pad (two 1.9x0.4mm pads, 1.0mm gap) rotated 90 deg so the terminals sit left/right; reduce the stencil to 2x 0.75x0.3mm apertures per pad as the datasheet recommends. Reflow only. https://look.ams-osram.com/m/1c356d580cdbe4ff/original/SFH-2704A.pdf")
